{
	"_help": "Act 4's dig camps at Akmentar (scripts/acts/akmentar_surface.gd: CAMPS; each camp's tents west of its fire at 6 m, its crates east and south). By day the American and German crews dig trenches north of their camps (digs) and carry baskets to the spoil (waypoints); at night (the level's _night > 0.5) they sit round the fire (night_seats, on logs) or sleep by the tents (sleep). A wiped-out camp's crew leaves with Crowd.remove_team(team). They are townsfolk, not gunmen: no team, no hitboxes, nobody targets them. Played by scripts/crowd.gd.",
